Use the drop=TRUE option to subscripting.  Here's an example:

> x=sample(letters, 5, replace=T)
> x
[1] "s" "a" "m" "e" "j"
> y=factor(x, levels=letters)
> y
[1] s a m e j
Levels: a b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z
> y[, drop=T]
[1] s a m e j
Levels: a e j m s

--Bruce

